<title>USA: MBIA qualifies eight bond issues for insurance.</title>
<headline>MBIA qualifies eight bond issues for insurance.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>MBIA Insurance Corp said Monday it qualified the following eight issues for insurance slated for competitive sale today.</p>
<p>--N.E. Johnson County C.S.D. 2, Kan., $2.5 million General Obligations (GOs).</p>
<p>--Onsted Community School, Mich., $11.575 million GOs.</p>
<p>--Moorhead I.S.D. 152, Minn., $5.15 million GOs.</p>
<p>--Mahtomedi, Minn., $1.615 million GOs.</p>
<p>--Farago Public School District, N.D., $6.32 million GOs.</p>
<p>--Mayville Sewage System Revenues, Wisc., $2.35 million.</p>
<p>--Wisconsin Indianhead Techical College, Wisc., $2.05 million GOs.</p>
<p>--Mayville Water, Wisc., $1.4 million Revenue bonds.</p>
<p>((--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650))</p>
</text>
